export const descriptions=["A small, cratered world of extremes. The closest planet to the Sun races through its orbit in just 88 Earth days.","Wrapped in thick clouds, Venus traps heat beneath its dense atmosphere. It is the hottest planet in our solar system.","Our pale blue dot. An ocean world with a protective atmosphere, and the only place where life is known to exist.","A rusty desert world with towering volcanoes and ancient riverbeds. Its landscape preserves clues to a wetter past.","The giant of our planetary family. Bands of cloud and vast storms swirl above an atmosphere of hydrogen and helium.","A world encircled by countless icy fragments. Saturn’s spectacular rings are broad, bright and remarkably thin.","A quiet-looking world with an extraordinary tilt. Uranus rolls around the Sun on its side beneath a blue-green atmosphere.","Cold, distant and windswept. Neptune is the outermost planet, circling the Sun far beyond the warmth of our home world.","A boundary in spacetime where gravity wins. Beyond the event horizon, no signal—not even light—can return to a distant observer.","The star at the center of our solar system. Nuclear fusion in its core powers the light and warmth that reach Earth.","Our nearest celestial neighbor. Craters and dark volcanic plains record its history, while its synchronized spin keeps the same side facing Earth.","A vast barred spiral of stars, gas and dust. Our entire solar system is one tiny neighborhood within its star-filled disk."];
